message: "Please cite this application when using its interactive research results explorer. DOI registration is pending."
type: software
title: "SG-DLS Research Lab: Interactive Steel-Truss Optimization Results Explorer"
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-10-22"
authors:
  - family-names: "Bahram Beigi"
    given-names: "Yousef"
    name-particle: ""
repository-code: "https://github.com/y0bahrambeigi/bhb/tree/main/apps/sgdls-research-lab"
url: "https://sgdls-research-lab.yousefbhb.chatgpt.site"
abstract: >-
  A Persian right-to-left research application for exploring a controlled
  steel-truss optimization ablation with two benchmarks, three methods and
  five paired seeds per method/benchmark. It presents final weight, runtime,
  feasibility, diagnostics, provenance and downloadable data. The 30 archived
  rows use 35,070 evaluator calls each. Statistical superiority of SG-DLS is
  not established. The implemented OpenAI assistant remains inactive pending
  runtime configuration and live verification. This application release is
  separate from the pending scientific release of BMPOA-FF-SG-DLS.
keywords:
  - steel truss
  - structural optimization
  - feasibility-first
  - SG-DLS
  - research software
  - reproducibility
